    <skos:note>Aggregated Response outcomes produced by VALIDATION_ENDDAYOFYEAR_INRANGE across a MultiRecord.</skos:note>
    <skos:prefLabel>Information Element ActedUpon bdqval:AggregatedTestResponseOutcomes for bdqtest:VALIDATION_ENDDAYOFYEAR_INRANGE.Response</skos:prefLabel>
